# 仓库统一 LF 行尾。以下关键运行文件即使 Windows 检出也强制 LF:
#   - *.sh:shebang(#!/usr/bin/env bash)遇 CRLF 会变成 bash\r 导致容器崩溃
#   - Dockerfile: 反斜杠续行遇 CRLF 会解析失败
#   - docker-compose.yml: YAML 统一 LF
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker/Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker/docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
docker/entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
